		{"id":"ad8c992f4c14a22f","type":"text","text":"","x":-374,"y":200,"width":250,"height":61},
		{"id":"d5ab19bab78211c0","type":"text","text":"Cavern description\n","x":-374,"y":-160,"width":250,"height":61},
		{"id":"ad0fe6b755562f7d","type":"text","text":"- Wake up in a dark cavern, dizzy and confused not really sure how you got here\n- Your body feels numb, unresponsive a cold breeze surrounds you\n- Fog covers your feet, from the walls of the cavern you hear a quiet pulsating beat.\n- You look arround and notice a fog wall covers the opposite side of the cavern, and see that you are not alone in this dark place.","x":80,"y":-159,"width":640,"height":199},
		{"id":"68049592dc02bd08","x":909,"y":-159,"width":1031,"height":199,"type":"text","text":"LOOK AT WHO EVER YOU ARE DESCRIBING\n- [[Niels]] a gaunt main with hazel eyes and disheveled hair, extinguishing the flames from his clothes\n- [[Seraphim the lost]] a tall rugged man with brownish gingered hair, looking at his broken helmet wondering what could have dones it\n- [[Nikolai Oak]] a man with long dark curly hair with a nasty scar on his face, wraping his wounds with his ravaged clothes\n- [[Rin and Machi]] an halfling with a lean athletic build with platinium hair reaching down her knees and a human  with very pale skin and dark brown short hair, helping eachother removing their handcuffs"}
	],
